# Publish portfolio changes

When a task changes this portfolio, commit the change and push `main` in the same turn. GitHub Pages deploys from that push. Do this without waiting for a separate publish request.

- Commit only the files for the task.
- Push `origin` `main` after the commit succeeds.
- Confirm the Pages deploy, then check the live site for the change.
- Leave other repositories unpushed unless the user asks to publish those too.
